Just unconscious. Got a proper whack, huh?

00:41:18.400 --> 00:41:20.330
Doctor, I need to tell you something.

00:41:20.670 --> 00:41:21.570
I have to tell you it now.

00:41:21.650 --> 00:41:22.230
Not a great moment.

00:41:22.350 --> 00:41:24.490
No, it's important. It has to be now.

00:41:32.620 --> 00:41:35.820
They're pregnant.

00:41:53.260 --> 00:41:53.740
Mr. No.

00:42:01.920 --> 00:42:02.100
Yeah.

00:42:56.680 --> 00:42:59.940
We are still go with Apollo 11.

00:43:00.640 --> 00:43:01.820
They are everywhere.

00:43:02.260 --> 00:43:05.480
It's like they edit themselves out of your memory as soon as you look away.

00:43:05.600 --> 00:43:06.860
20 seconds and counting.

00:43:06.940 --> 00:43:08.060
You still don't know what they look like.

00:43:08.740 --> 00:43:11.020
As long as there's been something in the corner of your eye,

00:43:11.120 --> 00:43:13.520
or creaking in your house, or breathing under your bed,

00:43:13.560 --> 00:43:14.740
or voices through a wall.

00:43:14.880 --> 00:43:15.800
T-minus ten.

00:43:16.060 --> 00:43:18.560
We are not fighting an alien invasion.

00:43:18.800 --> 00:43:20.160
We're leading a revolution.

00:43:20.440 --> 00:43:23.940
Five, four, three, two.

00:43:26.580 --> 00:43:28.060
Good luck and Godspeed.
